WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.980
Drivers & setup: drivers and their private links, carriers and shipping settings.

2
00:00:07.534 --> 00:00:12.200
Create a "New driver" and send the "Driver's private link" to them only.

3
00:00:12.753 --> 00:00:16.950
Under "Carriers", add carriers with "Add carrier".

4
00:00:17.502 --> 00:00:23.770
In "Settings", set the tracking prefix, "Instant quotes in DMs" and customer notices.

5
00:00:24.315 --> 00:00:28.100
When a driver leaves, cancel their link with "New link".
